sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as fa:fa-clock Rotation Schedule
    participant OP as fa:fa-key 1Password
    participant ENG as fa:fa-user-shield Engineer
    participant FLY as fa:fa-server Fly.io
    participant API as fa:fa-shield CloudForge API
    participant MON as fa:fa-chart-line Monitoring

    Note over SCH,MON: Trigger: 90-day schedule, leaked secret, or compliance audit

    SCH->>ENG: Rotation due (JWT / DB / API key)

    rect rgb(124, 58, 237, 0.1)
        Note over ENG,OP: Phase 1 — Generate & Store
        ENG->>ENG: Generate new secret<br/>openssl rand -base64 64
        ENG->>OP: Update 1Password vault item
        OP-->>ENG: Secret stored
    end

    rect rgb(30, 64, 175, 0.1)
        Note over ENG,API: Phase 2 — Deploy with Dual-Key
        ENG->>FLY: fly-sync-runtime-secrets.sh --apply
        FLY->>API: Rolling restart with new secret
        Note over API: Both old + new keys accepted<br/>Grace period: 24h
        API-->>FLY: Pods healthy
        FLY-->>ENG: Deploy confirmed
    end

    rect rgb(34, 197, 94, 0.1)
        Note over ENG,MON: Phase 3 — Validate
        ENG->>API: GET /health
        API-->>ENG: All components healthy
        ENG->>MON: Check logs for auth errors (5 min)
        MON-->>ENG: No auth failures detected
        ENG->>API: Smoke test: GET /api/v1/findings
        API-->>ENG: 200 OK — data returned
    end

    rect rgb(239, 68, 68, 0.1)
        Note over ENG,FLY: Phase 4 — Revoke Old Key
        ENG->>FLY: Unset JWT_PREVIOUS_SIGNING_KEY
        FLY->>API: Restart — single key only
        API-->>ENG: Healthy, old key rejected
    end

    ENG->>ENG: Clean up local key files<br/>rm *.pem *.txt
    ENG->>SCH: Schedule next rotation (90 days)

    Note over SCH,MON: Rollback: If auth failures detected,<br/>restore previous 1Password version + re-sync
